  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2220275ff8f91bf1",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 今日发布了新的 Sonnet 模型。他们称其 \"运行速度提升 30%+，且在大多数工作中成本可降低高达 30%\"——其定价与 Sonnet 5 相同，但在各项基准测试中似乎优于它，并且运行成本也应更低。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1bb7cda00919ec36",
      "translationZh": "这里有一些骑自行车的鹈鹕。Sonnet 5.5 与 Opus 5.5 出现了相同的错误：\"max\" 思考力度的鹈鹕在耗尽 128,000 个标记（成本为 1.28）之前进行了思考，随后因标记用尽而未能生成 SVG。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd9f8ca61d6d00cf",
      "translationZh": "这是它为思考力度 \"xhigh\" 生成的鹈鹕，成本为 5.74 美分，耗时 41 秒：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a8e78743891b575",
      "translationZh": "Sonnet 5.5 在某些编码任务上似乎几乎与 Opus 5.5 相当，包括各种病毒式传播的 3D 动画技巧。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad92d68517e94674",
      "translationZh": "Sonnet 5.5 最有趣的地方在于，它现在是 claude.ai 免费层级所使用的模型。OpenAI 的 ChatGPT 免费层级使用 Luna 5.6，这意味着 Anthropic 目前提供了一个功能更强大的免费服务。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f54942fa53dec993",
      "translationZh": "我在此免费层级上运行了此提示：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec41cfcf8c288c94",
      "translationZh": "构建一个使用 WebGL 渲染三维鹈鹕骑自行车的 HTML 页面。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ceaac1bedf0bcb78",
      "translationZh": "然后得到了这个页面，这是一个相当不错的尝试。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25d839966e506ffb",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 的宣布再次强调，Haiku 5.5 将在“即将到来的几周内”发布。我真的很希望它能与 GPT-6 Luna 在价格上具有竞争力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
